/*
 * Declares the CmpIntOperatorValue class.
 *
 * CmpIntOperatorValue represents binary comparison operations applied to two
 * integer operands. These comparisons evaluate the relative ordering or
 * equality of the operands and always produce a boolean result.
 *
 * Supported comparisons typically include:
 *   - equality / inequality,
 *   - relational comparisons(<, <=, >, >=).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
